    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/e7b3d5544253d2d73ee0fd04d2d59cf0.poster.avif?t=1722938136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/e7b3d5544253d2d73ee0fd04d2d59cf0.webm?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/e7b3d5544253d2d73ee0fd04d2d59cf0.mp4?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>VBR Clash is a <strong>challenging</strong> platformer where you must go through exasperating and sometimes maddening levels that requires skill and precision to complete. The <strong>different gamemodes</strong> will offers you different platforming experience to bring you one step closer to <strong>mastering the art of platforming</strong>.<br><br><br><strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>run</strong>, <strong>climb</strong> and <strong>dash</strong> your way through the <strong>blurred out world</strong> of VBR Clash and <strong>become the god of platformers</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/102d84a4e4ce5a512a94cddf28d816bb.poster.avif?t=1722938136\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/102d84a4e4ce5a512a94cddf28d816bb.webm?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/102d84a4e4ce5a512a94cddf28d816bb.mp4?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/2d50942fecc99ccea8453f540784d666.poster.avif?t=1722938136\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/2d50942fecc99ccea8453f540784d666.webm?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/2d50942fecc99ccea8453f540784d666.mp4?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/601feeec526fbd072e6bd69777f89580.poster.avif?t=1722938136\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/601feeec526fbd072e6bd69777f89580.webm?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/601feeec526fbd072e6bd69777f89580.mp4?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/beaf513cc3ddbfc53517b438b018106b.poster.avif?t=1722938136\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/beaf513cc3ddbfc53517b438b018106b.webm?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031140/extras/beaf513cc3ddbfc53517b438b018106b.mp4?t=1722938136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Precise &amp; Timed Platforming</li><li>Unique Abstract Art Style (inspired by old CRT graphics !)</li><li>3 Gamemodes (and an additional Hard Mode)</li><li>PC &amp; Gamepad Controls</li><li>Local Scoreboards!</li><li>Lots o